[ Title ]
Deep cavities at PF/linac/KEKB/IRON depths, full cosmic source v2
S6 proposal: 10_deep_allsrc upgrade — 15000 histories, ipnint=1,
four cavity depths + He-3 deposit tally (d2 geometry proxy).

